      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "bonogo": "evidence_gap",
        "caelynn": "evidence_gap",
        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the council chamber involves the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including elite guards), with reinforcements converging; council members are not explicitly confirmed present during the combat.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Participants (OBSERVED):\n  - Players: Actively in battle; central opposing force to the Wolf.\n  - the Wolf: Present in the Council Room; primary adversary using illusions and attempting escape.\n  - Thalia: In the chamber (\u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d); initially acts under the Wolf\u2019s influence and engages in combat.\n  - Guards: Multiple present, including \u201c8 regular guards and 2 elite guards\u201d; some are corrupted and actively fighting; more are \u201cbeing drawn here as reinforcements.\u201d\n\n- Not Confirmed:\n  - Council Members: While the Players previously \u201crecount their story to the council\u201d (OBSERVED governance), there is no explicit confirmation they remain present during the fight itself.\n\n- Environment (OBSERVED):\n  - Council chamber defenses (illusory walls, runes) are active.\n  - The room is disheveled and actively affected by combat (e.g., Fireball lighting the room).\n\nOverall, the chamber is a crowded, active combat zone centered on the Wolf, with guards and Thalia directly involved alongside the Players.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1",
      "question": "Who are the Shepherds, and what god or power do they answer to?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "shepherds",
        "maelthor",
        "cult"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
        "shepherds",
        "maelthor",
        "worship",
        "cult"
      ],
      "context_must_hits": [
        "shepherds",
        "maelthor",
        "worship",
        "cult"
      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "pass",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "shepherds": "hit",
        "maelthor": "hit",
        "worship": "retriever_gap",
        "cult": "hit"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a cult actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they serve the power of **Maelthor**, whose influence they believe is reshaping the world.\n\nThe **Shepherd\u2019s Flock** are a cult group currently staging a protest at the city gates (CANON). They recruit individuals\u2014especially those already \u201caffected\u201d or transformed\u2014and induct them into their cause (CANON/OBSERVED). Their doctrine frames violent or extreme acts as necessary \u201ccleansing\u201d to remove impurities and advance their vision of **human supremacy** (CANON).\n\nThey are explicitly identified as **followers of Maelthor** (OBSERVED), and their alignment centers on **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence** (OBSERVED). Internally, they justify sacrifices as serving a greater good tied to this power.\n\nThey also engage in covert activity (e.g., hiding corrupted meat, symbols found on guards), while publicly presenting themselves as defenders of humanity against non-human threats (CANON/OBSERVED).\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Cultists, followers of Maelthor  \n- Goals: Recruitment, \u201ccleansing\u201d the world, advancing human supremacy  \n- Activities: Protests, covert operations, indoctrination  \n- Alignment: Devoted to Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence  \n- Public Face: Protective, anti\u2013non-human threat narrative",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "headmaster tinkerbright",
        "wizard's college",
        "detect"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
        "headmaster tinkerbright",
