      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: Merril handles agriculture/food, Torrin represents the craft guilds, and Rurik oversees infrastructure and the city\u2019s structural integrity.\n\nMerril Tealeaf \u2014 Council role: Representative of Agriculture and Food Production (CANON/OBSERVED). She is the Leader of the Agricultural Union and focuses on food supply and public well-being.\n\nTorrin Flamescale \u2014 Council role: Representative of the Guilds / Craft Guilds (OBSERVED/CANON). As Master Smith, he speaks for craftsmen and industry.\n\nRurik Stonehammer \u2014 Council role: Representative of Infrastructure (CANON). As Chief Architect, he is responsible for the city\u2019s structural integrity and defenses.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Governance:\n  - Merril Tealeaf: Agriculture and food supply oversight\n  - Torrin Flamescale: Guilds and craftsmanship interests\n  - Rurik Stonehammer: Infrastructure and structural integrity\n- Titles:\n  - Merril: Leader of the Agricultural Union (OBSERVED)\n  - Torrin: Master Smith (OBSERVED)\n  - Rurik: Chief Architect (OBSERVED)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_battle_with_the_wolf_and_aftermath_1",
      "question": "When the council-chamber fight ends, where does that leave the Wolf-dead, fled, what?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "killed",
        "bonogo",
        "decapitated"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
